   "synthesis": "- Carbon-cycle process wording has been **repeated almost identically** → memorize direction of flux.\n- UPPCS repeatedly asks **Brundtland / Our Common Future / Limits to Growth / Agenda 21 / SDG mapping**.\n- Common qualifier trap: **10% law concerns energy transfer**, not a fixed 10% transfer of biomass/organic matter.\n- Niche ≠ habitat; succession ≠ seasonal change; nutrient cycles are cyclic while ecosystem energy flow is unidirectional."
