   "synthesis": "- Repeated UPSC move: **name → institutional home → legal/organisational character → objective**, not generic environmental awareness.\n- Distinguish **Convention / Protocol / Agreement / voluntary initiative / NGO / fund / intergovernmental organisation**.\n- Climate questions increasingly test:\n  - Kyoto vs Paris architecture;\n  - market vs non-market mechanisms;\n  - fund/operator identity;\n  - UN body vs World Bank/MDB vs NGO/private coalition;\n  - EU law vs global treaty.\n- UPPCS adds high-value direct recall:\n  - event chronology;\n  - observance dates;\n  - headquarters/secretariat;\n  - convention-purpose pairing.\n- **One-off platforms are a recurring question format but not stable permanent content.** Retain only a replaceable “initiative → launcher/host” anchor set."
